<title>USA: Omaha cattle firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were firm to $0.50 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1000-1300 lbs 66.50-68.00, few 68.50. Select 64.00-66.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to largely choice 2-4 975-1200 lbs 66.00-68.00, reputation fed 68.50. Select 64.00-66.00.</p>
